  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Laboratory Strengthening: Interim Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an&#xA0;interim activity to support essential laboratory services in Tonga,&#xA0;Samoa, Cook Islands, Solomon Islands and Vanuatu. It&#xA0;combines key&#xA0;outputs for&#xA0;two multi-country activities (Pacific Laboratory Quality Assurance and Covid-19: Strengthening Pacific Laboratories) with&#xA0;Pacific Pathology Training Centre while scoping and design is underway for New Zealand&apos;s future lab strengthening support in the Pacific to be established as a succeeding Activity, where Outcomes will be achieved.</narrative>
  </description>
